notices from the upstream project are retained in kimodo/ATTRIBUTIONS.MD.

The Mixamo, Unity and Rive bridge implementation, runtime renderer, packaging,
documentation, and installation changes were added by GuardSkill in 2026.

Rive runtime packages are downloaded from npm during installation and remain
under their respective upstream licenses. No example .riv character or model
weight is included in the published node package.
